  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ひかりを　ひつようと　していた\nネクロズマと　ルナアーラを\nぶんり　させるための　マシン。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "빛을 필요로 했던\n네크로즈마와 루나아라를\n분리시키기 위한 머신.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用來讓需要光的奈克洛茲瑪和\n露奈雅拉分離的機器。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un appareil permettant d’annuler la fusion d’un\nNecrozma assoiffé de lumière avec Lunala.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Necrozma, das Licht benötigte, kann mithilfe dieser\nMaschine wieder von Lunala getrennt werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Artefacto que permite separar a Necrozma, ávido\nde luz, tras su fusión con Lunala.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dispositivo che permette a Necrozma di separarsi\nda Lunala quando non necessita più di luce.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A machine to separate Necrozma, which needed\nlight, from Lunala.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "光を　必要と　していた\nネクロズマと　ルナアーラを\n分離　させるための　マシン。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
